{"parse":{"title":"Iron Nails","pageid":950,"revid":48194,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Iron nails</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/13/Iron_Nails.png/revision/latest?cb=20210213031256\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Iron nails\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/13/Iron_Nails.png/revision/latest?cb=20210213031256\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/13/Iron_Nails.png/revision/latest?cb=20210213031256 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/13/Iron_Nails.png/revision/latest?cb=20210213031256 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Iron nails\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-image-key=\"Iron_nails.png\" data-image-name=\"Iron nails.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i>Needed for advanced construction projects.</i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Material</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Internal ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">IronNails</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">Forge</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Building</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Weight</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">Stack</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">0.5</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">100</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"teleport\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle toccolours\" style=\"float: none;\"><span title=\"Can go through wood portal?\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Teleportable</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (Can go through wood portal?)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Yes</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Crafting Materials</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Crafts 10</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">Iron</a> x1</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Iron nails</b> are crafted at a <a href=\"/wiki/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">Forge</a> with a single <a href=\"/wiki/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">Iron</a> ingot which yields 10x nails each.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>Like <a href=\"/wiki/Bronze_nails\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bronze nails\">Bronze nails</a> (and unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Scrap_iron\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scrap iron\">Scrap iron</a> or iron ingots) they can be brought through portals.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIron_Nails%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Building\">Building</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIron_Nails%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" 